                            "question": "Find f'(4).",
                            "answer": "f'(t) = -120(1/2)t^(-1/2)/(1+sqrt(t))^2 = -60t^(-1/2)/(1+sqrt(t))^2. f'(4) = -60(4)^(-1/2)/(1+sqrt(4))^2 = -60(1/2)/9 = -10/3."
                        },
                        "latex": {
                            "question": "Find $f'(4)$.",
                            "answer": "$f'(t)=\\frac{-120(1/2)t^{-1/2}}{(1+\\sqrt{t})^2}=\\frac{-60t^{-1/2}}{(1+\\sqrt{t})^2}$. $f'(4)=\\frac{-60(4)^{-1/2}}{(1+\\sqrt{4})^2}=\\frac{-60(1/2)}{9}=-\\frac{10}{3}$."
                        }
